<section class="ziyu-section">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <div class="ziyu-support-hero">
      <div>
        <span class="ziyu-label">Support the Future</span>

        <h1 class="ziyu-h1">
          Investing in technology that honors the human spirit.
        </h1>
      </div>

      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">
        Support keeps the ecosystem independent, transparent, and focused on human flourishing instead of engagement metrics.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-card ziyu-funding-card">
      <div>
        <span class="ziyu-label ziyu-label--muted">Why Support Matters</span>

        <h2 class="ziyu-h2">
          This is how Ziyu avoids becoming another attention-driven platform.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-text-stack">
        <p class="ziyu-body-lg">
          Independent funding allows products to be designed around user well-being, not ad revenue, addiction loops, or endless engagement.
        </p>

        <p class="ziyu-body-lg">
          Every supporter helps fund design, development, infrastructure, writing, research, and long-term experimentation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-support-tiers">

      <div class="ziyu-card ziyu-support-tier">
        <span class="ziyu-label">Tier 01</span>

        <h2 class="ziyu-h3">
          Reader
        </h2>

        <p class="ziyu-body">
          Follow field notes, essays, and early project updates.
        </p>

        <a href="/pages/store" class="ziyu-card-link">
          Start Here →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card ziyu-support-tier ziyu-support-tier--featured">
        <span class="ziyu-label">Tier 02</span>

        <h2 class="ziyu-h3">
          Builder
        </h2>

        <p>
          Support active development, prototype refinement, and early experiments.
        </p>

        <a href="/pages/store" class="ziyu-card-link">
          Become a Builder →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card ziyu-support-tier">
        <span class="ziyu-label">Tier 03</span>

        <h2 class="ziyu-h3">
          Patron
        </h2>

        <p class="ziyu-body">
          Help shape the archive, product direction, and future ecosystem.
        </p>

        <a href="/pages/store" class="ziyu-card-link">
          Join Patronage →
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--soft">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <div style="max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 70px;">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Funding Breakdown</span>

      <h2 class="ziyu-h2">
        What support helps fund.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-grid-3">
      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 36px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 44px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 28px;">code</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Development</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 14px;">Engineering, app infrastructure, product systems, testing, and maintenance.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 36px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 44px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 28px;">edit_note</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Research & Writing</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 14px;">Essays, field notes, education, philosophy, product documentation, and archive writing.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 36px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 44px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 28px;">science</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Experiments</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 14px;">Hardware concepts, prototypes, user testing, design exploration, and future tools.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--dark">
  <div class="ziyu-manifesto">
    <span class="ziyu-label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);">
      Founding Circle
    </span>

    <h2 class="ziyu-h2">
      Help fund intentional technology.
    </h2>

    <p style="margin-top: 24px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);">
      Every contribution helps keep Ziyu independent, transparent, and centered on people.
    </p>

    <a href="/pages/store" class="ziyu-button ziyu-button--light" style="margin-top: 36px;">
      Support Through Store
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

